{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 6, :comments ["<b>This</b> — a hint to the generation in whose days the House was built, in the days of David, and afterward it returned to before HaShem, for this generation is they who seek Your face." "<b>Selah</b> — in truth." "<b>Jacob, selah</b> — the meaning is they are the seed of Jacob, and there is no need for interpretation, after it said: the word אלהי (God of) is missing before יעקב."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :register {:flags {2 ["God"]}}, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:25.370422435Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}